🍽️ MenuMaster

MenuMaster is a restaurant discovery and booking platform where users can explore restaurants, view menus, and make reservations quickly.

------------------------------------------------------------
FEATURES
------------------------------------------------------------
[✓] Restaurant Listing (Main Page)
- Shows restaurant cards dynamically from API
- “Show More Restaurants” pagination button
- Rating badge (⭐ 4.5 etc.)

[✓] Restaurant Card Details
- Restaurant name
- Restaurant rating
- City + Phone + Address displayed under the title
- “View Menu” button

[✓] About Us Page
- About MenuMaster section
- FAQ section

[✓] Responsive UI
- TailwindCSS based design
- Mobile menu support

[✓] Live Counter
- Shows how many people are “looking for food right now” (demo animation)

[✓] Support / Help Modal
- Support modal popup with email

------------------------------------------------------------
TECHNOLOGIES USED
------------------------------------------------------------
- HTML5
- CSS3
- TailwindCSS
- JavaScript (ES Modules)
- Axios
- REST API services (restaurantService, userService, authService)

