------------------------------------------------------------
INSTALLATION & RUN
------------------------------------------------------------
1) Download / Clone the project

2) Run with VS Code Live Server (Recommended)
- Open main-page.html
- Click "Go Live"

NOTE:
Live Server is recommended because ES module imports may not work correctly via file://

------------------------------------------------------------
MAIN PAGE RESTAURANT RENDERING
------------------------------------------------------------
Restaurants are fetched from API:

const response = await restaurantService.getAll();
renderRestaurants(response.data);

Restaurant cards are created inside:
- renderRestaurants() function

------------------------------------------------------------
CITY / PHONE / ADDRESS DISPLAY
------------------------------------------------------------
Under each restaurant title we show:
- City
- Phone number
- Address

IMPORTANT:
To avoid “escapeHtml is not defined” error:

Use this fix in main-page.js:
const escapeHtml = localEscapeHtml;

------------------------------------------------------------
COMMON ISSUES
------------------------------------------------------------
1) ERROR: "escapeHtml is not defined"
FIX:
const escapeHtml = localEscapeHtml;

2) City / Phone / Address not showing
Reason: API might return different field names.
Update these helpers if needed:

getRestaurantCity(r)
getRestaurantPhone(r)
getRestaurantAddress(r)

------------------------------------------------------------
ABOUT US PAGE
------------------------------------------------------------
Create aboutus.html and add:
- About MenuMaster section
- FAQ section
- aboutus.css for extra styling

